{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 40, :comments ["<b>And they shall take out the stones.</b> As the Targum renders: וִיִשְׁלְפוּן — they remove them from there, as in ״וְחָלְצָה נַעֲלוֹ״ (Deuteronomy 25) — a term of removal." "<b>To an unclean place.</b> A place where purities are not used there — Scripture teaches you that these stones defile their place while they are in it (Sifra)."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:06:28.284062834Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}